WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.700
It's totally late!

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.070
Sorry I made you tag along with me
after cram school.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:12.530
It's okay. I wanted to eat ice cream
at that shop anyway.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.330
But I was too scared to go alone.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:19.980
You Aoi, on the other hand, always do
whatever you set your mind to.

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:23.110
You can only restrain yourself
for so long!

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:26.890
I always end up going
along with the crowd.

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:29.320
Honestly I really envy
Aoi's personality.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.660
A-A flying person!

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.060
Uh-oh. I guess
I shouldn't have seen him.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:45.500
You saw that too, right Yuri?

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:49.070
That's Shishio-kun from my class!

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.510
There it is. Yoshimori!

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:00.750
It's pretty huge!

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.590
It's just a stupid charging bull.

00:01:05.490 --> 00:01:06.480
Ketsu!

00:01:08.800 --> 00:01:09.790
Oh no!

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.660
Yoshimori! Stop it!

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.110
He took your prey again.

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.350
You know! If you keep stealing
other people's prey,

00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:35.820
you'll never be popular with the girls!

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:37.860
Nope, that has nothing to do with this...

00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:47.840
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:49.700
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:54.910
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:56.810
(Fighting late into the night)

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.250
Drive away all hesitation

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:04.650
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:08.190
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:11.530
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:17.190
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:21.700
Sha la la la la...

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:28.110
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:30.080
(Secret romance)

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:35.280
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.050
(A strange distance)

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:43.890
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:44.960
Yeah

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:48.430
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:52.030
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:57.370
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.970
No way! Are you serious?

00:04:41.240 --> 00:04:43.300
Are you really really serious, Aoi?

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.840
You saw it too Yuri!

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.140
His bright, shining eyes that
pierce through the night,

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:51.620
his stoic expression
and that agility!

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.980
My encounter with him was destined
since our previous lives!

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:58.220
No, he looked dangerous,
no matter how you see it.

00:04:58.760 --> 00:04:59.420
Really?

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:02.400
I really think you should give up.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:03.730
Give up what?

00:05:04.430 --> 00:05:05.960
Ayano-chan and Kyoko-chan!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:10.400
Seeing how you two are talking...

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.830
I'm guessing you're advising
each other on love!

00:05:12.270 --> 00:05:13.830
I-It's not...

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.000
You can't fool me!
It's written all over your face, Yuri.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:18.670
Oh my.

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:20.140
So who is it?

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:23.480
There's a boy called Shishio
in my class.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.710
He's just so dreamy.

00:05:25.150 --> 00:05:27.590
Oh, the one they call the "bad boy"
transfer student?

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:31.450
Hey, Ayano, didn't you say
you liked "bad boys"?

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.860
Are you two going to fight
over him now?

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:35.550
I like the bad boys,

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.120
but I prefer the macho, fighting types!

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:40.160
So Aoi, you can rest assured
and go for it!

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:41.900
Thank you!

00:05:42.170 --> 00:05:45.300
N-No! He's bad! He's just bad!

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:47.430
Are you going to quit chasing
after Sumimura

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:48.600
and go for him instead?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.400
That's not what I meant!

00:05:52.980 --> 00:05:55.970
That guy is really dangerous!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:57.170
Why?

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:59.620
He was dressed in black last night.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:03.210
He must be a hitman hired
by some evil syndicate!

00:06:06.230 --> 00:06:08.700
An evil syndicate? A hitman?

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.490
Are your supernatural senses
making a comeback?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.060
Uh-oh! They'll hate me
for saying this!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:18.330
But as Aoi's childhood friend

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.240
I have to protect her from danger
she's really naïve!

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.010
You're misunderstanding him!

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:26.750
I bet he's descended from ninja

00:06:26.750 --> 00:06:29.240
who can read the wind. walk the water.
and dash over the land.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.820
He must be patrolling the town
in secret at night!

00:06:37.190 --> 00:06:41.460
That Shishio took my prey again last night!

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:43.730
U-Um. Sumimura-kun...

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.690
If you're an assistant,

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:49.430
act like one and stay in
the background!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:51.660
Um. Sumimura-kun...

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:58.350
I thought Aoi was weird,
but those two are something else.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:01.270
Well, you know what they say.
You don't fight unless you're really close.

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:05.810
This formula will come up on the test,

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:07.680
so be sure to write it down
in your notes.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:10.650
When multiplying polynomials,

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:15.190
you have to use the property of
distribution to multiply each element.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:18.920
When dividing, you either
have to use the divisor

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:22.200
or find the quotient by multiplying
the multiplicative inverse.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.170
What?! An ambush?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:31.610
Yup! It's the best way to
ask someone out!

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.950
According to Tabata,
there's no time to spare!

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.910
That Shishio from Class 1
is pretty popular.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:41.810
He even has a fan club
at the high school.

00:07:41.890 --> 00:07:42.580
Seriously?

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:45.150
In recent times the "bad boy"
is an endangered species.

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:46.450
There is no shortage of people

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:48.520
that want to take him
into custody for conservation!

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.160
Most of his information
comes from rumors

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.290
so it's very unreliable.

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.560
You know what they say.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:54.860
"Three rumors make a truth."

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:55.890
No one says that.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:59.570
Anyways, they say the early bird
gets the worm!

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:04.570
Yuri, you're her childhood friend...
you mediate for her!

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:08.480
No. no. no!
No! I can't do it!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:09.540
Why?

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.880
Because he's really scary!

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:16.950
Oh fine. I guess I'll have to do it.

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:18.090
There it is!

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:20.180
It's Kyoko's "Cupid of Love" move
straight from Europe!

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:21.890
She's a returnee after all!

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.120
You used to live abroad?

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:27.200
But didn't you say you're bad
at foreign languages?

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.200
Don't point that out!

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:30.360
Okay!

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:32.230
I'm going to go tell Aoi.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:34.900
Wait just a second!
You have to keep it a secret!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:37.410
We can tell her after it goes well!

00:08:37.580 --> 00:08:40.340
What? Then we're going to be doing
this all on our own?

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:49.710
No good!

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:54.520
I overslept! School's already over.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:08:58.130
Sumimura-kun! Are you there?

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:02.300
U-Um... There's something I want
to talk to you about.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:12.010
Well, my friend saw Shishio-kun
jumping over rooftops last night

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.270
and she seems to have
fallen for him.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:15.250
What? Shishio?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.040
Anybody but Shishio!

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:20.680
Listen, he's going to tear you apart
if you talk to him!

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.110
I knew it!

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:24.920
He's exactly what he looks like!

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.860
He's armed to the teeth and dangerous!

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:32.120
By the way, who's the weirdo
that likes him?

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:36.230
It's Shinagawa Aoi from Class 1.
You should know her too.

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.000
You went to elementary school
with her.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:42.040
What?! It's Shinagawa?! Who's that?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:47.280
What?! She's the girl that always
wins art contests!

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.920
Everyone keeps saying she's pretty!
Don't you remember?!

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:51.780
Art contest?

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:53.140
Pretty?

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:00.920
I guess I never remember any other
girls' faces except Tokine's.

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.120
U-Um, Sumimura-kun, are you okay?

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:09.170
Anyway, just stay away from him!
You got that?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:10.830
O-Okay...

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:19.040
Hey, can you come with me
for a second?

00:10:19.810 --> 00:10:22.010
She's already talking to him!

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:27.180
I'll be direct.
There's a girl that likes you.

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.050
She's a really nice girl.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.750
It's your classmate, Shinagawa Aoi.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:35.420
You know her, don't you?
The thin pretty girl.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:38.500
Can you just give her a minute?

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.270
Hey!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.370
Sorry. I got shot down.
The rest is up to you.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:55.480
I'll take care of it!
I'll take over from the European style!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.910
European style?

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:00.320
Does that mean getting back up
no matter how many times you fall?

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.820
Seeing how Kyoko failed,

00:11:02.860 --> 00:11:05.830
we don't have to worry about
other girls getting the jump on us!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:07.820
This is getting me pumped up!

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:11.160
I'm going to do whatever it takes
to present his heart to Aoi.

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:13.400
Great optimism!
Good luck to you!

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:14.960
Bring it on!

00:11:15.440 --> 00:11:18.230
Wow these two are really into this!

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:21.630
I can't stop runaway trains like them!

00:11:31.190 --> 00:11:32.520
What's wrong, Yuri?

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:35.890
You said you were doing something
with Ayano-chan and Kyoko-chan today.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:39.890
No... Wait, I didn't know you had a dog.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:43.190
I picked him up on my way home
from school.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:44.450
You know this morning...

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.170
I decided to keep him

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:58.940
if no one took it in
on my way back from school.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.570
Oh. Shishio-kun was feeding the puppy...

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:04.780
Maybe he just couldn't leave it alone.

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.550
He's actually
a very kind-hearted person.

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:09.120
Oh...

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.950
No! I have to convince her
to forget about him!

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.050
Or else Aoi will be in danger!

00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.790
But he doesn't seem to have
many friends at school

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:21.360
and he always looks like
he's about to kill someone.

00:12:21.400 --> 00:12:22.960
Aren't you afraid of him?!

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:25.900
Maybe he's like that because
he's a lone warrior.

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:28.410
Maybe he's really kind deep down.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.900
As a descendant of ninja,
his job is to defend the peace in this town...

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:39.550
Maybe he can only get
a brief moment of comfort

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.180
when he's with a puppy.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.490
Yuri, you understand, don't you?

00:12:46.760 --> 00:12:47.990
Huh?! Yeah!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.590
Um... Wait...

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:53.620
Shoot.
She's convincing me now...

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.100
What should I do?

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.300
Still...

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:06.310
I never thought anyone
would like somebody like Shishio.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:15.250
Wait. If they become a couple,

00:13:15.290 --> 00:13:17.720
maybe I can take Tokine out
on a double date with them?

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.490
I'm so happy!

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:24.160
That's why I keep
saying you're naïve!

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:28.130
Why do you have to appear
in my imagination?!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:30.570
Double dates are not gonna happen!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.310
Hello?

00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:47.180
Hey. How're you doing?

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:50.720
Chief... There is something
I have to report to you.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.790
I see.

00:14:02.170 --> 00:14:05.540
It came for the bounties
on the Kekkaishi. huh?

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:11.670
You have something
like a bounty placed on you.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:16.380
This site... I'm glad they told me
about this wonderful place!

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.780
Someone is sending Ayakashi,

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:22.020
telling them they'll get the reward
if they kill the Kekkaishi,

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:23.960
so that they don't have to
get their hands dirty.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.060
I don't know for sure.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:31.790
but it seems like they're gathering
information very carefully.

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:33.900
All right. I'll try to find out
more from my end.

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:36.230
Umm...

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:39.300
Keep working and assist in
the protection of the Karasumori Site.

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:41.300
If you find out anything, let me know.

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:45.740
Yes. But Chief...
How long do I have to stay here?

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.070
Indefinitely.

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:48.300
What?!

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:50.120
If you want to, that is...

00:14:51.150 --> 00:14:54.590
Just take it easy.
I'll call you again later.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:01.430
School life just isn't my thing.

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.270
What?!

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.440
Yoshimori, you're too slow!
Hurry it up!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:22.740
Damn, did Shishio get ahead of me again?

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:24.810
What?!

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:25.840
Gen-kun!

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:30.420
Looks like the Kekkaishi of
Karasumori are here!

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:33.060
Hang on, Shishio!
I'll help you!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:35.490
Don't mind me!
Hurry up and get that thing!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.860
Shut your mouth!

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:42.200
Now then. I have no intention
of harming you.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:46.400
I just want to stay here for a little bit.
Just a little.

00:15:46.440 --> 00:15:47.930
I can't let you do that!

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:51.670
It's our job to remove or destroy
the Ayakashi that come here!

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.520
Then, let me show you
something nice.

00:15:54.520 --> 00:15:55.980
I'll make this appear
out of thin air!

00:15:55.980 --> 00:15:57.180
See. see. see. see. see?

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:00.240
- Ketsu!
- Ketsu!

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.280
- Metsu!
- Metsu!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.780
What? This is nothing.

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:06.260
Maybe it's trying to catch us off guard.

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:10.460
I was only testing you!

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:18.530
What is this?!
A plain smoke screen?

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:26.710
What was that?!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.410
It must be wind cutters
he created from his staff.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:31.610
Wind cutters?

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:34.710
Simply put,
they're weapons made of wind.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:36.040
It'll be difficult to deal with

00:16:36.090 --> 00:16:37.790
if he throws those wind cutters
through the smoke screen.

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:41.060
Yoshimori! We have to retreat
and think of a plan!

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:42.920
All right!

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:48.430
Are you running? That's disappointing!

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:50.660
I'll take this chance to absorb

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:53.040
as much power as
I can from this land!

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:05.540
He uses a smoke screen
when he attacks.

00:17:05.590 --> 00:17:07.820
so I don't think he's good in combat.

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:11.680
But we can't fight those kinds
of Ayakashi head on.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.820
We have to set up a trap of our own.

00:17:14.400 --> 00:17:18.460
I see. An eye for an eye,
a tooth for a tooth, right?

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.670
That's the kind of plan
I expect from you.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:22.360
You give back double,
of what he gave you.

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:26.530
We fight magic tricks with
magic tricks of our own!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.910
So I'm going to be the decoy?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.740
I'll leave that to you.
I'll go save Gen-kun!

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:35.250
I'll do it! So I just have to
make him mad, right?

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:43.350
Oh my. I thought you
ran away, you runt.

00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:45.520
Don't call me a runt! Ketsu!

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.500
He broke it!

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.960
If you keep interfering with me,

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.260
I can't guarantee your friend's safety!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:04.910
Oh?! It's empty!

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.440
All right! You did it, Tokine!

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:12.150
We were just the decoys!
You're such a dummy!

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:16.650
I'll get you! With a "pop"!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.410
Nails!

00:18:25.230 --> 00:18:26.960
Yoshimori! Move on to the next plan!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.760
All right! Hoi! Joso!

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:29.500
Ketsu!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.940
This is nothing!

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:35.230
You move so much, it's annoying!

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:38.440
It's the smoke screen!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:40.670
Here's the plan.

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:43.150
First we get him to
use a smoke screen.

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:46.280
We make walls of Kekkai around him
on all four sides.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:48.450
To prevent him from
breaking the wall

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:50.820
we'll form another one under him
right away and push him up.

00:18:51.260 --> 00:18:52.890
That's where you come in.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:57.030
The only problem is we don't know
which way he'll go when we push him up.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:58.760
That won't be a problem.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.930
As long as you
don't lose sight of me.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:03.530
Huh?

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:07.840
Yoshimori! It might be hard,
but can you do this?!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.270
I can do it, no problem!
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:14.170
W-What?

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:18.610
Are they going to
ambush me from above?

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:20.450
I'll just swat them down!

00:19:20.650 --> 00:19:23.420
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:26.380
What?! He's too fast!
Where is he coming from?

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.050
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:31.590
Stop saying "Ketsu" so much!

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.590
You are a girl!

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:36.930
Curses!

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:55.090
Gen-kun's speed...

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:57.890
He's pretty reliable.

00:20:07.500 --> 00:20:09.230
I'm so sleepy...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:12.500
Time for the declaration of love.

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:15.240
I wonder if they'll go out.

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:19.180
This is a sketchbook full of
drawings I made of you.

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:21.010
Would you please accept it?

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.340
- What?!
- What?!

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:26.750
Oh my.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.460
Shot down. unable to break
through the fortress.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:42.000
I just don't get him.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:44.670
If someone as cute as Aoi
says she likes him,

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:46.100
who wouldn't be happy?!

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.210
I'm so sorry, Aoi.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:51.840
No. It's probably because
he's a descendant of ninja,

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:54.900
so he can't be bothered with love.

00:20:55.880 --> 00:20:58.210
He's the epitome of manly romanticism!

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.650
Um I don't think he's a ninja...
Wait what? "Manly romanticism"?

00:21:04.420 --> 00:21:06.790
But I'm glad I met Gen.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.150
Huh? Gen?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:11.200
Yes. I named the puppy
from the other day.

00:21:11.600 --> 00:21:13.760
Oh, that puppy.

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:16.090
You named it Gen. of all names?

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:20.370
He's very cute. I already taught him
to sit and shake.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:23.140
You can let a dog satisfy you
in his place?

00:21:23.310 --> 00:21:27.540
I know! Maybe I should train Gen
to become a ninja dog.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:30.580
Aoi! You're going to give up on love
and become a dog breeder?!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:51.260
You know...
You could have been nicer to her.

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:55.770
I heard this from Kanda and Tabata.

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:58.000
but you seem to be really popular
with the girls.

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.810
I personally don't get why.

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:05.810
Shinagawa Aoi seems like a nice girl.

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:08.680
She'll hate me eventually.

00:22:09.060 --> 00:22:10.050
What?!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:15.090
When they find out who I really am,
they'll all despise me.

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:22.570
Really? I don't think so...

00:22:46.330 --> 00:22:50.020
With a look on your face that says
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:50.060 --> 00:22:53.290
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.460
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:01.060
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.310 --> 00:23:04.870
Trying to avoid an emergency
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:08.850
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:12.910
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:16.180
I am it's common sense

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:20.520
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:26.500
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:32.830
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:34.810
(If that's true)

00:23:34.840 --> 00:23:39.510
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:42.950
Please Please Please

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:47.150
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.490
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:54.760
You watch from far away

00:23:54.800 --> 00:24:00.760
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:02.870
Hey Hey
